# qqcandy runtime model/project detection.
#
# Single-SKU tree: OnePlus Ace Racing Edition (PGZ110, project 22801).
# OPPO K10 (PGJM10, project 21143) is the same board and uses the same image;
# its camera path is the 21143 set. This service only reports what the
# bootloader says; it never mutates read-only product properties.

service qqcandy-model /vendor/bin/qqcandy-model.sh
    class late_start
    user root
    group root
    oneshot
    disabled

# Deliberately not started automatically. The helper is a diagnostic tool and
# does not attempt to mutate read-only product properties. Enable it manually
# once a device-specific SELinux domain exists for it:
#
#   adb root
#   adb shell setprop ctl.start qqcandy-model
